            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 68-year-old woman had the acute occlusion of a coronary artery by PTCA failure acute occlusion of a femoral artery by the IABP insertion. The patient underwent on pump beating coronary bypass and axillo-femoral bypass simultaneously.</AbstractText>
